<title>USA: Conagra names Bruce Rohde president.</title>
<headline>Conagra names Bruce Rohde president.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>ConAgra Inc said it named general counsel Bruce Rohde vice chairman and president.</p>
<p>The company also said it created an office of the chairman to consist of Rohde; chairman and chief executive Philip Fletcher, 63; and the ConAgra Refrigerated Foods unit president and chief operating officer Leroy Lochmann.</p>
<p>&quot;This clearly positions Rohde as the leading candidate&quot; to replace Fletcher upon retirement, said ConAgra spokeswoman Lynn Phares.</p>
<p>Shares in ConAgra were unchanged at 43-1/8.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
